86435550 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6b798538-8660-5c1f-9d93-5bdad8bdb40c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435550 #edb/ref 1074 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x+y-{z}^{2})=1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x+y-{z}^{2})=1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(x+y-{z}^{2})=-2z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(1,0,1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,0,1) & =1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,0,1) & =1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,0,1) & =-2(1)=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-0 & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,0,1)+(y-0)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,0,1)+(z-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,0,1) \\\\ w & =(x-1)+y-2(z-1) \\\\ w & =x+y-2z+1 \\\\ x+y-2z-w+1 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435554 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435556 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435554 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0af89c86-dd82-51d3-8a60-9428fdaf17c3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435554 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435551 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435555 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "52566cd2-c610-5b7e-a93b-8dfb407f2200" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435555 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435553 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435556 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435557 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435556 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8189ee1b-e555-5395-af62-45720087b2f5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435556 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186435550 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435557 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186435555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186435557 #edb/ref 1062 #uu